      "id": "exam/edexcel-8ma0-01-specimen/q1",
      "question": "<p>A curve has equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y = 2x^3 - 2x^2 - 2x + 8\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(a) Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{dy}{dx}\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(b) Hence find the range of values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\"></span> for which <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\"></span> is increasing.</p><p>Write your answer in set notation.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></p>",
