      "id": "exam/edexcel-8ma0-01-specimen/q2",
      "question": "<p>The quadrilateral <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"OABC\"></span> has <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{OA} = 4\\mathbf{i} + 2\\mathbf{j}\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{OB} = 6\\mathbf{i} - 3\\mathbf{j}\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{OC} = 8\\mathbf{i} - 20\\mathbf{j}\"></span>.</p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(a) Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{AB}\"></span>.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(b) Show that quadrilateral <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"OABC\"></span> is a trapezium.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p>",
