      "id": "exam/edexcel-8ma0-01-specimen/q10",
      "question": "<p>A circle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span> has centre <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2, 5)\"></span>. Given that the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P(-2, 3)\"></span> lies on <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span>.</p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(a) find an equation for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span>.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p><p>The line <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l\"></span> is the tangent to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span> at the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span>. The point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Q(2, k)\"></span> lies on <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l\"></span>.</p><p class=\"exam-subpart\">(b) Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span>.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(5)</span></p>",
